  m_text: '- <b>[W][A][S][D] / Arrow Keys:</b> Move character

    - <b>[Left Click]:</b>
    Plant seeds (when holding seed) / Harvest crops

    - <b>[Key E]:</b> Interact
    with Kitchen Pot, Storage Chest, Statue, Dungeon Portal

    - <b>[Key I]:</b>
    Open / Close Backpack Inventory

    - <b>[Sleep]:</b> Approach Bed and press
    <b>[E]</b> to advance day and crop cycles

    - <b>[Key ESC]:</b> Open / Close
    this Menu at any time in Base'
